UID:ocad-u-150-anniversary-community-launch-event@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:OCAD U students\, faculty\, staff and alumni – join us for a
  kick-off to our 150th anniversary year.\n\nStarting this fall and through
 out the academic year\, OCAD U is celebrating 150 years of impact made by 
 our students\, graduates\, faculty and staff - across art\, design\, cultu
 re and the economy - and how we continue to shape what’s next. All facul
 ty\, staff and students are invited to a 150th anniversary community launc
 h event on Tuesday\, Oct. 20 from 2 – 4 p.m. in the Great Hall. There wi
 ll be a brief program with speeches and a video followed by a reception wi
 th snacks. Learn more about the University’s anniversary at OCADU.ca/150
LOCATION:The Great Hall 100 McCaul St.
